{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19274","headline":"和令狐相公谢太原李侍中寄蒲桃 · 刘禹锡","name":"和令狐相公谢太原李侍中寄蒲桃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珍果出西域，移根到北方。\n昔年随汉使，今日寄梁王。\n上相芳缄至，行台绮席张。\n鱼鳞含宿润，马乳带残霜。\n染指铅粉腻，满喉甘露香。\n酝成十日酒，味敌五云桨。\n咀嚼停金盏，称嗟响画堂。\n慙非末至客，不得一枝尝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}